{
  "kind": "boltworks-plugin-package",
  "packageVersion": 1,
  "manifest": {
    "kind": "boltworks-plugin",
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "id": "bws-ai-modeling",
    "name": "BWS AI Modeling",
    "version": "1.0.1",
    "description": "Optional AI-only modeling bridge for BoltWorksConnect. Installs the BWS AI tool catalog without embedding those tool definitions in the editor.",
    "runtime": "assets",
    "apiVersion": 5,
    "enabled": false,
    "contributes": {
      "aiToolsFile": "ai-tools.json"
    }
  },
  "files": {
    "ai-tools.json": {
      "mediaType": "application/json",
      "data": "[\n  {\"name\":\"bws_get_connection\",\"description\":\"Identify the paired BWS browser workspace and active AI plugin.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"connection\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_get_capabilities\",\"description\":\"Read supported BWS operations, limits, units, axes, and current engine capabilities before editing.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"capabilities.get\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_get_scene\",\"description\":\"Read the current scene and its editable objects.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"scene.get\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_get_selection\",\"description\":\"Read the current BWS selection.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"selection.get\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_get_audit\",\"description\":\"Read the latest workspace audit and operation history.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"audit.get\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_model_qa_sheet\",\"description\":\"Return an inline QA-sheet PNG with all six full-model camera views and the loaded project reference image.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_create_objects\",\"description\":\"Create explicitly described objects in the paired BWS scene.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"objects.create\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_create_mesh_from_reference_image\",\"description\":\"Create an editable BWS mesh from a base64 reference image and explicit generation parameters.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"referenceMatch.createMesh\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_combine_objects_into_shell\",\"description\":\"Fuse exact scene object IDs into one editable outer shell, replacing source parts. Hard limit per call: at most 8 source objects and 40,000 total source triangles. Read scene triangle counts first; for larger models, fuse nearby parts in smaller groups and then fuse the resulting shells in later calls.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"destructive\":true,\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"objects.combineShell\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_update_objects\",\"description\":\"Update exact objects in the paired BWS scene.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"objects.update\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_delete_objects\",\"description\":\"Delete exact objects from the paired BWS scene.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"destructive\":true,\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"objects.delete\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_set_selection\",\"description\":\"Set the selected objects in the paired BWS scene.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"selection.set\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_parts\",\"description\":\"List editable mesh parts with stable IDs, names, checked state, and triangle counts.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_preview_image\",\"description\":\"Return the dedicated Triangle Sculpt preview with model patch, cursor, and selection.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_qa_sheet\",\"description\":\"Return the Triangle Sculpt QA composite with the loaded reference image.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_viewport_image\",\"description\":\"Return only the largest visible BWS workspace canvas.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_prepare\",\"description\":\"Prepare exact parts as the active sculpt target with optional subdivision.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_look_at_selected\",\"description\":\"Focus the sculpt preview and cursor on a selected part.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_state\",\"description\":\"Read the active sculpt target, triangle selection, cursor, radius, mode, and bounds.\",\"access\":\"read\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_set_tool\",\"description\":\"Set the virtual sculpt cursor center, radius, and selection mode.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_select_local\",\"description\":\"Select triangles, vertices, edges, or faces around the virtual cursor.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_select_grid\",\"description\":\"Select triangle centroids in a projected front, side, or top grid rectangle.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_select_brush\",\"description\":\"Select nearby projected triangle centroids with a bounded brush.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_subdivide_local\",\"description\":\"Subdivide only the selected local sculpt patch within the triangle safety ceiling.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_symmetrize_patch\",\"description\":\"Apply uniform subdivision, centerline treatment, or mirrored patch topology.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_push_pull\",\"description\":\"Deform the current sculpt selection along normals or a world axis with falloff controls.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_relax\",\"description\":\"Relax or smooth the selected sculpt patch with boundary preservation controls.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_sculpt_clear_selection\",\"description\":\"Clear the active sculpt selection without changing mesh geometry.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"sculpt\"}},\n  {\"name\":\"bws_undo\",\"description\":\"Undo the most recent BWS edit.\",\"access\":\"edit\",\"handler\":{\"kind\":\"bridge\",\"method\":\"undo\"}}\n]\n"
    },
    "README.md": {
      "mediaType": "text/markdown",
      "data": "# BWS AI Modeling plugin\n\nThis optional plugin owns the AI-facing BoltWorksConnect tool catalog. BWS does not expose the Connect AI control unless this package is installed and enabled.\n\nInstall `plugin.bwsplugin` from BWS **Plugins > Install from file**, review its AI edit permissions, then enable it. Disable or remove it to disconnect and remove the AI tools.\n\nThe package is declarative: it contains tool names, descriptions, access levels, and mappings to BWS's validated editor operations. It does not execute downloaded JavaScript and cannot bypass BWS validation, revision checks, undo history, or connection consent.\n\nShell fusion is limited to 8 source objects and 40,000 total source triangles per call. AI clients must inspect scene triangle counts and combine larger models in staged groups.\n\nThe broader target API and acceptance criteria are recorded in `SPEC.md`. Version 1 exposes operations already implemented by BWS; future operations belong in this plugin contract after the corresponding safe engine capability exists.\n"
    },
    "SPEC.md": {
      "mediaType": "text/markdown",
      "data": "# BWS AI Modeling target contract\n\nThe source design is maintained in `bwc-ai-plugin-spec.md`. Its intended architecture is a parametric, revisioned recipe with numeric measurement and QA before rendering. The target includes scene/object revision APIs, atomic batches, distance/clearance/thickness/symmetry measurements, manifold and normals QA, bounded render passes, history, and isolated variants.\n\nVersion 1 of this plugin exposes the safe BWS operations that currently exist. Unimplemented target tools are not advertised to AI clients.\n"
    }
  }
}
